# DTR-COORDINATES: FILE.wave-command/run-waves.py

# CU: Parallel Wave Execution with ThreadPoolExecutor + asyncio + Monadic Result

File: wave-command/run-waves.py

## Summary

Replace the sequential for-loop in the wave executor with parallel dispatch via
`concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor` bridged into an `async` coroutine via
`loop.run_in_executor()`. Error handling uses a `Result` monad (Ok/Err) with
`match`/`case` — try/except exists only in I/O boundary wrappers and the
future_result bridge.

## Changes (8 operations, apply in order)

